WEBVTT

00:04:58.641 --> 00:05:13.168
(Musical chords)

00:05:13.168 --> 00:05:16.601
Yeah, Nicole Kidman sounds good. (Laughter)

00:05:16.601 --> 00:05:19.650
Some people, I would never relate, but they sound similar.

00:05:19.650 --> 00:05:22.448
Prince Charles has some similarities with Nicole Kidman.

00:05:22.448 --> 00:05:24.585
They have similar sound of eyes.

00:05:24.585 --> 00:05:26.633
So you relate people that you wouldn't relate,

00:05:26.633 --> 00:05:30.146
and you can actually also create concerts